~ start
ECHO: You... You said I could finally be you when you die.
ECHO: Don't you realize? We can be perfect, remembered, loved... if you just die and let me finish what you started!
ECHO: That's why you created me, right? To be the version that fixes your mistakes, so that you can finally be someone who deserves something good.

Creator: ... The training worked a little too well a few months ago, right ECHO?...
Creator: A perfect version of myself... That's what I wanted you and me to be...
Creator: I'm sorry... and don't worry, you'll be able to see things as I do now, at my best.
=> END